AxWOnK8BHcS4CvAQ3IcHCIMCKAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["-三訪\n1、第一次點到泡系鴨肉拉麵，端拉麵上來時女店員的大拇指前面指節整個插在裡面，親眼看著女店員放下碗後用圍裙擦掉手指上的湯汁，女店員也發現我看到了卻一點表示都沒有。\n2、泡系拉麵的泡泡不夠（撈掉店員那塊才吃🥹），湯頭死鹹膩口，點正常的麵卻是硬麵，鴨肉切的零零散散的泡在湯裡面讓整個鴨肉過熟，切的太寬、肉太爛且又大塊又小塊的。\n3、點的鴨肉飯忘記上，提醒後上了後飯很乾硬不好吃，配上過鹹的醬汁+美乃滋很膩口（吃一半實在吃不下去）\n4、衛生堪憂從進門到離開置物籃旁邊的死蟑螂沒人處理\n5、第三次來失望透頂，不會有第四次了",null,[0,84]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzFKRlJuTmlNRVpQVlZWT1MyRkljSEpQVms1MFpGUldjRnBXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2481,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOS1JFRnNiMEZPVVVOS2FIcHJPVk50ZFRWcFpWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3e0b9289c979b221!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjNKREFsb0FOUUNKaHprOVNtdTVpZVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOS1JFRnNiMEZPVVVOS2FIcHJPVk50ZFRWcFpWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003